(7125033, 1089647, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful how the light highlights the horse''s face.  Intriguing expression.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Beautiful how the light highlights the horse''s face.  Intriguing expression.  Nice capture.', '2013-11-03 11:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125035, 1089501, 150277, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  I love the deep colors of the sky with just a silhouette of the airplane.</td>', 'Very cool photo.  I love the deep colors of the sky with just a silhouette of the airplane.', '2013-11-03 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125036, 1089823, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wow, you had to be quick to capture this photo. Nice sharpness.</td>', 'Wow, you had to be quick to capture this photo. Nice sharpness.', '2013-11-03 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125037, 1089738, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I love the color on the camel amidst the muted background.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I love the color on the camel amidst the muted background.', '2013-11-03 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125042, 1089427, 150277, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  The duck stands out so sharply.  Beautiful colors in the water too.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  The duck stands out so sharply.  Beautiful colors in the water too.', '2013-11-03 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125048, 1089837, 150277, '<td valign="top">Neat capture.  I like the rich color and uniqueness of the photo created by the reflection.</td>', 'Neat capture.  I like the rich color and uniqueness of the photo created by the reflection.', '2013-11-03 11:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125050, 1088592, 150277, '<td valign="top">What a special shot.  I hope this was your boat.  I wish the duck has been a bit larger, but still, such a unique scene.</td>', 'What a special shot.  I hope this was your boat.  I wish the duck has been a bit larger, but still, such a unique scene.', '2013-11-03 11:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125128, 1089050, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Such a serene scene with a pop of color.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Such a serene scene with a pop of color.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2013-11-03 16:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125132, 1089685, 150277, '<td valign="top">I found this photo very dramatic.  The model is stunning, yet non-traditional.  The pink evoked a feeling of excitement and mystery to me.</td>', 'I found this photo very dramatic.  The model is stunning, yet non-traditional.  The pink evoked a feeling of excitement and mystery to me.', '2013-11-03 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125137, 1089586, 150277, '<td valign="top">Neat photo.  I love how prominent the sculpture is in the scene and that the background seems small.  The truth, I am guessing, is that the background is just immense and the sculpture likely smaller(?).  Great perspective and lovely photo.</td>', 'Neat photo.  I love how prominent the sculpture is in the scene and that the background seems small.  The truth, I am guessing, is that the background is just immense and the sculpture likely smaller(?).  Great perspective and lovely photo.', '2013-11-03 16:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125141, 1089608, 150277, '<td valign="top">Intriguing scene.  I love the darkness in the distance.  This photo made me wonder about the story. A little haunting.</td>', 'Intriguing scene.  I love the darkness in the distance.  This photo made me wonder about the story. A little haunting.', '2013-11-03 16:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125143, 1089175, 150277, '<td valign="top">Such brilliant colors and texture to their feathers.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Such brilliant colors and texture to their feathers.  Beautiful shot.', '2013-11-03 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125145, 1084827, 150277, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  Lovely capture.</td>', 'Adorable.  Lovely capture.', '2013-11-03 17:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125146, 1089130, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The perfect balance of trees and water and sky to me.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The perfect balance of trees and water and sky to me.', '2013-11-03 17:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125161, 1086562, 18367, '<td valign="top">Great image, good timing and DOF.  <br/> <br/>It may very well be my monitor, but the image does not seem to be as crisp as it could be.  The sun seems at its peak and may have some impact on the image. Have they started the rodeo competitions in Emerald already. I do believe I had the good fortune of visiting that location the last time I was in Australia.<br/> <br/>The very best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Great image, good timing and DOF.   It may very well be my monitor, but the image does not seem to be as crisp as it could be.  The sun seems at its peak and may have some impact on the image. Have they started the rodeo competitions in Emerald already. I do believe I had the good fortune of visiting that location the last time I was in Australia. The very best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2013-11-03 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7125163, 1088796, 18367, '<td valign="top">Photo prise du Boulevard Champlain?<br/> <br/>Très belle image.<br/> <br/>Very nice capture.  Here is hoping you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Photo prise du Boulevard Champlain? Très belle image. Very nice capture.  Here is hoping you do well in the challenge.', '2013-11-03 18:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
