(7125464, 1089496, 114225, '<td valign="top">In this case, the scene is wonderful, but the shadows are interfering with my viewing. Maybe a bit of HDR technique here to open those shadows would be nice.</td>', 'In this case, the scene is wonderful, but the shadows are interfering with my viewing. Maybe a bit of HDR technique here to open those shadows would be nice.', '2013-11-04 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
