(7125489, 1089784, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. If the vignette wasn''t present, I think I wold vote this even higher.</td>', 'Nicely done. If the vignette wasn''t present, I think I wold vote this even higher.', '2013-11-04 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
