(7126485, 1088783, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous sense of scale.  It would have been interesting without the person, but with the person it''s sublime.</td>', 'Fabulous sense of scale.  It would have been interesting without the person, but with the person it''s sublime.', '2013-11-07 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
