(7126729, 1089496, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection, a bit too low imo. The foreground rock jutting out is competing with claustrophobic distant hills. A slightly higher POV excluding the rock and including a bit more sky...would then have been a 9. Instead I''m being generous with a 7. Art, go figure.</td>', 'Lovely reflection, a bit too low imo. The foreground rock jutting out is competing with claustrophobic distant hills. A slightly higher POV excluding the rock and including a bit more sky...would then have been a 9. Instead I''m being generous with a 7. Art, go figure.', '2013-11-07 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
