(7126767, 1089720, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. The hewn from pewter tones and highlights.<br/> <br/>2. The honest/authentic looked despite the clearly posed subject.<br/> <br/>3. Great lighting.<br/> <br/>4. The shadow detail exactly where it is needed.<br/> <br/>5. The crispness of the processing.<br/> <br/>Super portrait.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. The hewn from pewter tones and highlights. 2. The honest/authentic looked despite the clearly posed subject. 3. Great lighting. 4. The shadow detail exactly where it is needed. 5. The crispness of the processing. Super portrait.', '2013-11-07 16:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
