(7127187, 1089629, 108580, '<td valign="top">Another under appreciated image. It''s not easy to shoot flashless in a museum and get sharp, well composed images in tight spaces with dozens of people bumping and stepping in front of you. The D700 sensor at ISO6400 is just unbelievable but it is the D3 sensor. It''s been on my shopping list for years... 7 from me and keep it up!</td>', 'Another under appreciated image. It''s not easy to shoot flashless in a museum and get sharp, well composed images in tight spaces with dozens of people bumping and stepping in front of you. The D700 sensor at ISO6400 is just unbelievable but it is the D3 sensor. It''s been on my shopping list for years... 7 from me and keep it up!', '2013-11-08 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
