(7127550, 1089828, 32011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, along with the many others, of the day.  You''re vision has always amazed me Deb.  It was so great to meet you in person, and to share the experience of Disney California Adventure with you... and to have some of YOUR photos capture the experiences and memories is absolutely wonderful. Once again, thank you for making the effort to come out the Anaheim to meet us, thank you for sharing the day with us, in person and in photos.<br/> <br/>ETA: As I mentioned earlier, if/when we make it back to LA area in the next two years, I hope we can get together again, perhaps for a bike ride... <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-08 22:51:21.</i></td>', 'Wonderful photo, along with the many others, of the day.  You''re vision has always amazed me Deb.  It was so great to meet you in person, and to share the experience of Disney California Adventure with you... and to have some of YOUR photos capture the experiences and memories is absolutely wonderful. Once again, thank you for making the effort to come out the Anaheim to meet us, thank you for sharing the day with us, in person and in photos. ETA: As I mentioned earlier, if/when we make it back to LA area in the next two years, I hope we can get together again, perhaps for a bike ride... ', '2013-11-08 22:49:28.000000', '2013-11-08 22:51:21.000000', 0),
