(7129631, 1088613, 30982, '<td valign="top">You can have DPC add a copyright after the challenge has ended.  Open this challenge entry to edit it, and you''ll see Watermark options.  Leaving them off during voting (one week period) is to preserve some sense of anonymity during voting, but afterwards, you can turn on the watermark to protect your images.  (And by the way, it''s spelled "Copyright")</td>', 'You can have DPC add a copyright after the challenge has ended.  Open this challenge entry to edit it, and you''ll see Watermark options.  Leaving them off during voting (one week period) is to preserve some sense of anonymity during voting, but afterwards, you can turn on the watermark to protect your images.  (And by the way, it''s spelled "Copyright")', '2013-11-13 18:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
