(7134364, 1086988, 165513, '<td valign="top">I completely forgot to look and see what this placed. The shallow DOF is caused by using my lens in reverse in order to use my 50mm as a macro. I took the lens off, turned it around and held it in front of the camera, this creates a macro free lens effect, but as you can see, it''s tricky because DOF is extremely shallow. Thanks for comments!</td>', 'I completely forgot to look and see what this placed. The shallow DOF is caused by using my lens in reverse in order to use my 50mm as a macro. I took the lens off, turned it around and held it in front of the camera, this creates a macro free lens effect, but as you can see, it''s tricky because DOF is extremely shallow. Thanks for comments!', '2013-11-24 19:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
